    "title": "Active Budget Can Kill Sensitivity: Diagnosing and Repairing TopK Sparse Autoencoder Reliability",
    "citation": "Zhen-Ting Huang et al., 2026",
    "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.37857",
    "authors": "Zhen-Ting Huang; Bo-Han Jiang; J. Liu; Zhi-Xing Tan; Qian-Ren Mao",
